TI  - Successful anesthetic management during abdominal wall-lifting laparoscopic cholecystectomy in a patient with hereditary angioedema.
AU  - Fujii M
AU  - Higashiguchi T
AU  - Shime N
AU  - Kawabata Y
PY  - 2018
