TI  - Consecutive Severe Orofacial Complications in Intensive Care Unit Patients: Quincke's Disease and Macroglossia due to Prolonged Prone Positioning for Management of Acute Respiratory Distress Syndrome.
AU  - Belfeki N
AU  - Zayet S
AU  - Sy O
AU  - Coupry LM
AU  - Mazerand S
AU  - Chouchane I
AU  - Moini C
AU  - Monchi M
