TI  - Ten-year study of causes of moderate to severe angioedema seen by an inpatient allergy/immunology consult service.
AU  - Banerji A
AU  - Oren E
AU  - Hesterberg P
AU  - Hsu Y
AU  - Camargo CA Jr
AU  - Wong JT
PY  - 2008
