TI  - Contact and intrinsic coagulation pathways are activated and associated with adverse clinical outcomes in COVID-19
AU  - Henderson, M.W.
AU  - Lima, F.
AU  - Moraes, C.R.P.
AU  - Ilich, A.
AU  - Huber, S.C.
AU  - Barbosa, M.S.
