TI  - Action of substance P and PAMP(9-20) on different excitation sites of MRGPRX2 induces differences in mast cell activation
AU  - Che, D.
AU  - Zheng, Y.
AU  - Hou, Y.
AU  - Du, X.
AU  - Jia, T.
AU  - Zhao, Q.
