TI  - Safety and outcomes associated with the pharmacological inhibition of the kinin–kallikrein system in severe covid-19
AU  - Mansour, E.
AU  - Palma, A.C.
AU  - Ulaf, R.G.
AU  - Ribeiro, L.C.
AU  - Bernardes, A.F.
AU  - Nunes, T.A.
AU  - Agrela, M.V.
