TI  - Extracellular acidification-induced CXCL8 production through a proton-sensing receptor OGR1 in human airway smooth muscle cells: A response inhibited by dexamethasone
AU  - Kadowaki, M.
AU  - Yamada, H.
AU  - Sato, K.
AU  - Shigemi, H.
AU  - Umeda, Y.
AU  - Morikawa, M.
AU  - Waseda, Y.
