TI  - Hereditary angioedema with C1 inhibitor (C1-INH) deficit: The strength of recognition (51 cases)
AU  - Fragnan, N.T.M.L.
AU  - Tolentino, A.L.N.
AU  - Borba, G.B.
AU  - Oliveira, A.C.
AU  - Simões, J.A.
