TI  - A plant proteinase inhibitor from Enterolobium contortisiliquum attenuates pulmonary mechanics, inflammation and remodeling induced by elastase in mice
AU  - Theodoro-Júnior, O.A.
AU  - Fraga Righetti, R.
AU  - Almeida-Reis, R.
AU  - Martins-Oliveira, B.T.
AU  - Oliva, L.V.
