TI  - Intratracheal administration of mesenchymal stem cells modulates tachykinin system, suppresses airway remodeling and reduces airway hyperresponsiveness in an animal model
AU  - Urbanek, K.
AU  - De Angelis, A.
AU  - Spaziano, G.
AU  - Piegari, E.
AU  - Matteis, M.
AU  - Cappetta, D.
